==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|151|Ponyta|77}} from the {{TCG|151}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Ponyta}}.
*'''Singe''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Cyndaquil|104}} and {{TCG ID|Expedition|Ponyta|126}}, both from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

